= Social Democracy: Spain 2015–2026

July 2014. Pedro Sánchez has just won the PSOE's first open primary. Ahead: the end of the two-party system, the rise of Podemos and Ciudadanos, and later Vox. Win power, keep it, and keep a PP majority, or a large PP–Vox majority, from closing every path to government.

